      "writtenOn": "2024-04-25T21:31:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mmm this is weird as bluetooth is [allowed to interract accros user](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/apex/permissions/com.android.bluetooth.xml;l\u003d25;drc\u003d4b3f331149025ee02deeacf2745ca375505d28a8) and it also have the [PACKAGE_USAGE_STATS](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/apex/permissions/com.android.bluetooth.xml;l\u003d32;drc\u003d4b3f331149025ee02deeacf2745ca375505d28a8) required by the getUidImportance api.\n\nBut this may due because the threading is **NOT** handled correctly (or actually in this case, not handled at all as we don\u0027t even look into it) and we still have the identity of the caller/binder when making the external call.",
      "parentUuid": "a82e8200_ee6aa26a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 717,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 717,
